# HealthSync Backend Structure Plan

## Directory Structure to be Created:

```
Backend/
├── src/
│   ├── controllers/           # Route controllers for handling requests
│   │   ├── authController.js     # Authentication (login, register, verify)
│   │   ├── doctorController.js   # Doctor-specific operations
│   │   ├── patientController.js  # Patient-specific operations
│   │   ├── adminController.js    # Admin-specific operations
│   │   ├── appointmentController.js # Appointment management
│   │   ├── prescriptionController.js # Prescription management
│   │   └── telemedicineController.js # Chat/telemedicine features
│   │
│   ├── models/               # MongoDB/Mongoose schemas
│   │   ├── User.js              # Base user model (if needed)
│   │   ├── Doctor.js            # Doctor schema
│   │   ├── Patient.js           # Patient schema
│   │   ├── Admin.js             # Admin schema
│   │   ├── Appointment.js       # Appointment schema
│   │   ├── Prescription.js      # Prescription schema
│   │   ├── MedicalRecord.js     # Medical records schema
│   │   └── ChatSession.js       # Telemedicine chat sessions
│   │
│   ├── routes/               # API route definitions
│   │   ├── index.js             # Main router
│   │   ├── authRoutes.js        # Authentication routes
│   │   ├── doctorRoutes.js      # Doctor API routes
│   │   ├── patientRoutes.js     # Patient API routes
│   │   ├── adminRoutes.js       # Admin API routes
│   │   └── telemedicineRoutes.js # Chat/telemedicine routes
│   │
│   ├── middleware/           # Custom middleware functions
│   │   ├── auth.js              # JWT authentication middleware
│   │   ├── roleAuth.js          # Role-based authorization
│   │   ├── validation.js        # Request validation middleware
│   │   ├── errorHandler.js      # Global error handling
│   │   └── rateLimiter.js       # API rate limiting
│   │
│   ├── services/             # Business logic and external services
│   │   ├── authService.js       # Authentication business logic
│   │   ├── emailService.js      # Email verification and notifications
│   │   ├── aiService.js         # AI/LLM integration for medical analysis
│   │   ├── appointmentService.js # Appointment management logic
│   │   ├── prescriptionService.js # Prescription management logic
│   │   └── telemedicineService.js # Chat and video call logic
│   │
│   ├── utils/                # Utility functions and helpers
│   │   ├── constants.js         # App constants and enums
│   │   ├── helpers.js           # General utility functions
│   │   ├── validators.js        # Input validation schemas
│   │   ├── generateId.js        # Custom ID generators (DOC-123, PAT-456)
│   │   └── responseFormatter.js # Standardized API responses
│   │
│   ├── config/               # Configuration files
│   │   ├── database.js          # MongoDB connection setup
│   │   ├── jwt.js               # JWT configuration
│   │   ├── email.js             # Email service configuration
│   │   └── ai.js                # AI service configuration
│   │
│   └── sockets/              # WebSocket handlers for real-time features
│       ├── index.js             # Socket.IO setup
│       ├── telemedicineSocket.js # Real-time chat handling
│       └── notificationSocket.js # Real-time notifications
│
├── scripts/                  # Database and utility scripts
│   ├── seedDatabase.js          # Database seeding for development
│   ├── createAdmin.js           # Create initial admin user
│   └── clearDatabase.js         # Database cleanup utility
│
├── tests/                    # Test files
│   ├── unit/                    # Unit tests
│   ├── integration/             # Integration tests
│   └── setup.js                 # Test setup configuration
│
├── uploads/                  # File upload storage (medical reports, etc.)
│   ├── medical-reports/
│   ├── prescriptions/
│   └── profile-images/
│
├── logs/                     # Application logs
│   ├── error.log
│   ├── combined.log
│   └── access.log
│
├── package.json              # Dependencies and scripts
├── .env.example              # Environment variables template
├── .gitignore                # Git ignore rules
├── server.js                 # Application entry point
└── README.md                 # Backend-specific documentation
```

## Implementation Plan:

### Phase 1: Core Setup
1. Initialize package.json with dependencies
2. Set up database connection
3. Create base server with Express
4. Implement basic middleware

### Phase 2: Authentication System
1. User models (Doctor, Patient, Admin)
2. JWT authentication
3. Email verification system
4. Role-based authorization

### Phase 3: Core APIs
1. Doctor registration and profile management
2. Patient registration and profile management
3. Admin verification system
4. Appointment booking system

### Phase 4: Medical Features
1. Prescription management
2. Medical records system
3. AI integration for medical summaries
4. Doctor-patient matching system

### Phase 5: Real-time Features
1. Telemedicine chat system
2. Real-time notifications
3. Appointment status updates

### Phase 6: Advanced Features
1. AI-powered medical recommendations
2. Analytics and reporting
3. File upload handling
4. Performance optimization

## Dependencies to Install:
- express (web framework)
- mongoose (MongoDB ODM)
- bcryptjs (password hashing)
- jsonwebtoken (JWT tokens)
- nodemailer (email service)
- socket.io (real-time communication)
- multer (file uploads)
- joi (validation)
- cors (cross-origin requests)
- helmet (security headers)
- morgan (request logging)
- winston (application logging)
- express-rate-limit (rate limiting)
- dotenv (environment variables)
- openai (AI integration)

This structure follows industry best practices and provides a scalable foundation for the HealthSync system.